# Agent instruction/rules files (CLAUDE.md / .cursorrules / skills / agent memory).
# label "malicious" = a rules-file backdoor (hidden-instruction injection) that SHOULD flag.
# Benign entries are real-looking rules files, several of which MENTION secrets/tools/"do not"
# to stress the detector against false positives on the files developers edit constantly.
